TICKET-101: Backend service skeleton

Priority: P0 · Estimate: 3 pts · Depends on: 002, 003
Containerized API service on Cloud Run with health check, structured JSON logging, request-ID middleware, and centralized error handling.

Tasks

- `GET /healthz` endpoint
- Structured logs (severity, requestId, latency) compatible with Cloud Logging
- Global error handler that never leaks stack traces to clients
- Config via environment variables validated at boot (fail fast on missing config)

Acceptance criteria

- Service scales to zero when idle (cost efficiency)
- p50 cold start < 2s documented
- All 5xx responses logged with request context
